{
  "type": "ai-phone-status-region",
  "version": 1,
  "contract": "【逻辑】你在维护推特(X)个人主页。每行一个字段用=分隔。推文符合剧情。生成至少3条网友评论，但你只挑1-2条回复（不回填\"无\"）。随机生成一个小剧场（笑话、真心话大冒险、匿名提问等，正文细节必须丰富，至少100字以上）。不要输出除格式以外的内容。按生成的内容整块用 [状态栏]...[/状态栏] 包裹输出。\n【格式】\n[状态栏]\n名字=<你的昵称>\n账号=<你的账号名，如 @jichi_123>\n✅头像=https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/07/23/FNIjpErD.jpg\n✅背景图=https://s3.bmp.ovh/2026/07/23/SQXCLGcC.jpg\n简介=<一句个人简介，随剧情心境更新>\n关注=<数字>\n粉丝=<数字，可带万>\n心声=<一句真实的内心独白>\n焦虑值=<0-100的数字>\n推文=<时间>|<正文>|<转发数>|<评论数>|<点赞数>|<浏览量>\n评论=<网友昵称>|<网友评论>|<你的回复，只回1-2个，其余填\"无\">|<点赞数>\n评论=<网友昵称>|<网友评论>|<你的回复，只回1-2个，其余填\"无\">|<点赞数>\n评论=<网友昵称>|<网友评论>|<你的回复，只回1-2个，其余填\"无\">|<点赞数>\n小剧场=<标题>|<正文内容，描述具体情境，至少100字>\n[/状态栏]",
  "renderHtml": "<style>\n  :root {\n    --bg: #ffffff;\n    --text: #0f1419;\n    --sub: #536471;\n    --accent: #1d9bf0;\n    --line: #eff3f4;\n    --hover: rgba(15, 20, 25, 0.03);\n  }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n    :root {\n      --bg: #000000;\n      --text: #e7e9ea;\n      --sub: #71767b;\n      --line: #2f3336;\n      --hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);\n    }\n  }\n  \n  /* 允许容器滚动，隐藏滚动条，整体字号调小 */\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font: 13.5px/1.4 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n    color: var(--text);\n    background: transparent;\n    padding-bottom: 24px;\n    height: 100vh; \n    overflow-y: auto; \n    scrollbar-width: none; \n  }\n  body::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n\n  .tw-card { background: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line); position: relative; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  \n  /* X Logo */\n  .x-logo-wrap { position: absolute; top: 10px; right: 12px; width: 20px; height: 20px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; z-index: 10; }\n  .x-logo { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: #fff; }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { .x-logo { fill: #fff; } }\n\n  .banner { height: 80px; background: #333; background-size: cover; background-position: center; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;}\n  .profile { padding: 10px 12px; position: relative; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .avatar-wrap {\n    width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid var(--bg);\n    position: absolute; top: -30px; background: #1d9bf0; overflow: hidden;\n    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n    color: white; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;\n  }\n  .avatar-wrap::after { content: \"TAP\"; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5); font-size: 8px; text-align: center; padding: 1px 0; font-weight: 800; }\n  .avatar-wrap img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }\n  \n  .actions { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-bottom: 6px; height: 28px;}\n  .btn-follow { background: var(--text); color: var(--bg); border: none; border-radius: 9999px; padding: 0 14px; height: 28px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }\n  \n  .name-block { margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  .name { font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; }\n  .verified { fill: var(--accent); width: 16px; height: 16px; }\n  .handle { color: var(--sub); font-size: 13px; }\n  .bio { font-size: 13.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }\n  .stats { display: flex; gap: 12px; color: var(--sub); font-size: 13px; }\n  .stats b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }\n  \n  /* 推文区块紧凑化 */\n  .tweet-main { padding: 10px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); position: relative;}\n  .tm-header { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;}\n  .tm-head-left { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center;}\n  .tm-x-logo { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: var(--sub); flex-shrink: 0;}\n  .tm-ava { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 50%; overflow: hidden; background: #1d9bf0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; }\n  .tm-ava img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }\n  .tm-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; }\n  .tm-handle { color: var(--sub); font-size: 13px; }\n  .tm-text { font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.45; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .hashtag { color: var(--accent); }\n  .tm-meta { color: var(--sub); font-size: 13px; padding-bottom: 0px; border-bottom: none; }\n  .tm-stats { display: flex; gap: 16px; padding: 10px 0 0 0; border-top: none; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 13px; color: var(--sub); margin-top: 4px; padding-bottom: 10px;}\n  .tm-stats b { color: var(--text); font-weight: 700; }\n  .tm-actions { display: flex; justify-content: space-around; padding-top: 10px; color: var(--sub); }\n  \n  /* 评论区紧凑化 */\n  .thread-title { padding: 10px 12px 0; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; }\n  .thread { display: flex; padding: 10px 12px; transition: background 0.2s; }\n  .thread.has-line { padding-bottom: 0; }\n  .th-left { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; margin-right: 10px; }\n  .th-ava { width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ccc; flex-shrink: 0; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:bold; color:#fff; overflow: hidden; font-size: 13px;}\n  .th-ava img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }\n  .th-line { flex: 1; width: 2px; background: var(--line); margin-top: 4px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .th-right { flex: 1; min-width: 0; padding-bottom: 10px; }\n  .thread:not(.has-line) { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }\n  .thread.has-line .th-right { border-bottom: none; }\n  .th-header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 4px; white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; }\n  .th-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); font-size: 14px;}\n  .th-handle { color: var(--sub); font-size: 13px; }\n  .th-replying { color: var(--sub); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 2px; }\n  .th-text { margin-top: 4px; font-size: 14px; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }\n  .th-actions { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; max-width: 250px; margin-top: 10px; color: var(--sub); }\n  \n  .action-btn { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer; }\n  .action-btn svg { fill: currentColor; width: 16px; height: 16px; }\n  .action-btn.like.liked { color: #f91880; }\n\n  /* 小剧场紧凑化 */\n  .theater { padding: 12px; margin: 12px; background: var(--line); border-radius: 10px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }\n  .theater::before { content: \"\"; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; bottom: 0; width: 3px; background: #8250b8; }\n  .th-box-title { font-weight: 800; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--text); font-size: 14px;}\n  .th-tag { background: #8250b8; color: #fff; padding: 2px 5px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; text-transform: uppercase;}\n  .th-box-content { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--text); white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }\n\n  /* 隐藏模态框 */\n  .modal { display: none; position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6); z-index: 100; align-items: center; justify-content: center; backdrop-filter: blur(2px); }\n  .modal.show { display: flex; animation: fadeIn 0.2s ease; }\n  @keyframes fadeIn { from{opacity:0;} to{opacity:1;} }\n  .m-card { background: var(--bg); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px; width: 250px; box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); transform: scale(0.95); transition: 0.2s ease; }\n  .modal.show .m-card { transform: scale(1); }\n  .m-title { font-weight: 800; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 12px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;}\n  .m-close { background: var(--line); width:24px; height:24px; border-radius:50%; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; cursor:pointer; font-size: 13px; }\n  .m-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--sub); margin-bottom: 4px; font-weight: 700; }\n  .m-text { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 14px; font-style: italic; color: var(--accent); }\n  .m-bar-bg { background: var(--line); height: 6px; border-radius: 3px; overflow: hidden; }\n  .m-bar-fill { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ff7a00, #f91880); height: 100%; border-radius: 3px; transition: width 0.5s ease; }\n  .m-val { float: right; color: #f91880; font-weight: 700; }\n</style>\n\n<div id=\"app\"></div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var G=[[\"#1d9bf0\",\"#0c7abf\"],[\"#00ba7c\",\"#009a66\"],[\"#f91880\",\"#d60a6a\"],[\"#ffd400\",\"#e5be00\"],[\"#8250b8\",\"#6a3d99\"],[\"#ff7a00\",\"#e05a00\"]];\n  function grad(s){ var n=0;for(var i=0;i<s.length;i++)n+=s.charCodeAt(i); var g=G[n%G.length]; return \"linear-gradient(135deg,\"+g[0]+\",\"+g[1]+\")\"; }\n  function el(tag,cls,txt){ var e=document.createElement(tag); if(cls)e.className=cls; if(txt!=null)e.textContent=txt; return e; }\n\n  var icons = {\n    verified: '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"verified\"><g><path d=\"M22.5 12.5c0-1.58-.875-2.95-2.148-3.6.154-.435.238-.905.238-1.4 0-2.21-1.71-3.998-3.918-3.998-.47 0-.92.084-1.336.25C14.818 2.415 13.51 1.5 12 1.5s-2.816.917-3.337 2.25c-.416-.165-.866-.25-1.336-.25-2.21 0-3.918 1.792-3.918 4 0 .495.084.965.238 1.4-1.273.65-2.148 2.02-2.148 3.6 0 1.46.816 2.72 2.008 3.4-.05.234-.078.476-.078.72 0 2.21 1.71 3.998 3.918 3.998.334 0 .656-.042.962-.118.825 1.134 2.158 1.834 3.654 1.834s2.83-1.002 3.654-1.834c.305.076.628.118.962.118 2.21 0 3.918-1.792 3.918-4 0-.244-.028-.486-.078-.72 1.192-.68 2.008-1.94 2.008-3.4z\"></path><path d=\"M14.42 9.615L11.5 13.11l-1.92-1.92-1.414 1.414 2.626 2.626.707.708.707-.707 3.635-4.364-1.42-1.25z\" fill=\"#fff\"></path></g></svg>',\n    reply: '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><g><path d=\"M1.751 10c0-4.42 3.584-8 8.005-8h4.366c4.49 0 8.129 3.64 8.129 8.13 0 2.96-1.607 5.68-4.196 7.11l-8.054 4.46v-3.69h-.067c-4.49.1-8.183-3.51-8.183-8.01zm8.005-6c-3.317 0-6.005 2.69-6.005 6 0 3.37 2.77 6.08 6.138 6.01l.351-.01h1.761v2.3l5.087-2.81c1.951-1.08 3.163-3.13 3.163-5.36 0-3.39-2.744-6.13-6.129-6.13H9.756z\"></path></g></svg>',\n    rt: '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><g><path d=\"M4.5 3.88l4.432 4.14-1.364 1.46L5.5 7.55V16c0 1.1.896 2 2 2H13v2H7.5c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4V7.55L1.432 9.48.068 8.02 4.5 3.88zM16.5 6H11V4h5.5c2.209 0 4 1.79 4 4v8.45l2.068-1.93 1.364 1.46-4.432 4.14-4.432-4.14 1.364-1.46 2.068 1.93V8c0-1.1-.896-2-2-2z\"></path></g></svg>',\n    like: '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><g><path d=\"M16.697 5.5c-1.222-.06-2.679.51-3.89 2.16l-.805 1.09-.806-1.09C9.984 6.01 8.526 5.44 7.304 5.5c-1.243.07-2.349.78-2.91 1.91-.552 1.12-.633 2.78.479 4.82 1.074 1.97 3.257 4.27 7.129 6.61 3.87-2.34 6.052-4.64 7.126-6.61 1.111-2.04 1.03-3.7.477-4.82-.561-1.13-1.666-1.84-2.908-1.91zm4.187 7.69c-1.351 2.48-4.001 5.12-8.379 7.67l-.503.3-.504-.3c-4.379-2.55-7.029-5.19-8.382-7.67-1.36-2.5-1.41-4.86-.514-6.67.887-1.79 2.647-2.91 4.601-3.01 1.651-.09 3.368.56 4.798 2.01 1.429-1.45 3.146-2.1 4.796-2.01 1.954.1 3.714 1.22 4.601 3.01.896 1.81.846 4.17-.514 6.67z\"></path></g></svg>',\n    xLogo: '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"x-logo\"><path d=\"M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z\"></path></svg>',\n    xLogoSub: '<svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"tm-x-logo\"><path d=\"M18.244 2.25h3.308l-7.227 8.26 8.502 11.24H16.17l-5.214-6.817L4.99 21.75H1.68l7.73-8.835L1.254 2.25H8.08l4.713 6.231zm-1.161 17.52h1.833L7.084 4.126H5.117z\"></path></svg>'\n  };\n\n  function bindLike(btn) {\n    btn.onclick = function(e){\n      e.stopPropagation();\n      this.classList.toggle(\"liked\");\n      var t = this.childNodes[1]; if(!t) return;\n      var n = parseInt(t.textContent.replace(/,/g,\"\")) || 0;\n      t.textContent = \" \" + (this.classList.contains(\"liked\") ? n+1 : n-1);\n    };\n  }\n\n  var d = {}, cmts = [];\n  (window.STATUS_RAW||\"\").split(/\\r?\\n/).forEach(function(line){\n    var i=line.indexOf(\"=\");if(i<1)return;\n    var k=line.slice(0,i).trim(), v=line.slice(i+1).trim();\n    if(k===\"评论\") cmts.push(v); else d[k]=v;\n  });\n\n  var name = d[\"名字\"] || \"User\";\n  var handle = d[\"账号\"] || \"@user\";\n  var avatarUrl = d[\"✅头像\"];\n  var bgUrl = d[\"✅背景图\"];\n  var anxietyNum = parseInt(d[\"焦虑值\"]) || 0;\n  \n  var app = document.getElementById(\"app\");\n  var card = el(\"div\", \"tw-card\");\n  \n  var xIcon = el(\"div\", \"x-logo-wrap\");\n  xIcon.innerHTML = icons.xLogo;\n  card.appendChild(xIcon);\n  \n  var banner = el(\"div\", \"banner\");\n  if(bgUrl && /^https?:\\/\\//.test(bgUrl)) {\n    banner.style.backgroundImage = \"url('\" + bgUrl + \"')\";\n  } else {\n    banner.style.background = grad(name + \"bg\");\n  }\n  card.appendChild(banner);\n\n  var prof = el(\"div\", \"profile\");\n  var avaWrap = el(\"div\", \"avatar-wrap\");\n  if(avatarUrl && /^https?:\\/\\//.test(avatarUrl)) {\n    var im = el(\"img\"); im.src = avatarUrl; avaWrap.appendChild(im);\n  } else {\n    avaWrap.textContent = name.slice(0,1); avaWrap.style.background = grad(name);\n  }\n  \n  avaWrap.onclick = function() {\n    var m = document.getElementById(\"secModal\");\n    if(m){\n      m.classList.add(\"show\");\n      var fill = m.querySelector(\".m-bar-fill\");\n      if(fill){\n        fill.style.width = \"0%\";\n        setTimeout(function(){ fill.style.width = anxietyNum + \"%\"; }, 50);\n      }\n    }\n  };\n  prof.appendChild(avaWrap);\n\n  var acts = el(\"div\", \"actions\");\n  acts.appendChild(el(\"button\", \"btn-follow\", \"Follow\"));\n  prof.appendChild(acts);\n\n  var nblock = el(\"div\", \"name-block\");\n  var nline = el(\"div\", \"name\");\n  nline.appendChild(document.createTextNode(name));\n  var veri = document.createElement(\"span\"); veri.innerHTML = icons.verified; nline.appendChild(veri);\n  nblock.appendChild(nline);\n  nblock.appendChild(el(\"div\", \"handle\", handle));\n  prof.appendChild(nblock);\n\n  if (d[\"简介\"]) prof.appendChild(el(\"div\", \"bio\", d[\"简介\"]));\n\n  var stats = el(\"div\", \"stats\");\n  var s1 = el(\"span\"); s1.innerHTML = \"<b>\" + (d[\"关注\"]||0) + \"</b> Following\";\n  var s2 = el(\"span\"); s2.innerHTML = \"<b>\" + (d[\"粉丝\"]||0) + \"</b> Followers\";\n  stats.appendChild(s1); stats.appendChild(s2);\n  prof.appendChild(stats);\n  card.appendChild(prof);\n\n  if (d[\"推文\"]) {\n    var p = d[\"推文\"].split(\"|\");\n    var tm = el(\"div\", \"tweet-main\");\n    \n    var tm_head = el(\"div\", \"tm-header\");\n    var tm_head_l = el(\"div\", \"tm-head-left\");\n    \n    var tma = el(\"div\", \"tm-ava\");\n    if(avatarUrl && /^https?:\\/\\//.test(avatarUrl)) {\n      var tmi = el(\"img\"); tmi.src = avatarUrl; tma.appendChild(tmi);\n    } else {\n      tma.textContent = name.slice(0,1); tma.style.background = grad(name);\n    }\n    tm_head_l.appendChild(tma);\n    \n    var tmn = el(\"div\");\n    var tm_name = el(\"div\", \"tm-name\", name); \n    var tm_veri = document.createElement(\"span\"); tm_veri.innerHTML = icons.verified; \n    tm_veri.style.width=\"16px\"; tm_veri.style.height=\"16px\"; tm_name.appendChild(tm_veri);\n    tmn.appendChild(tm_name);\n    tmn.appendChild(el(\"div\", \"tm-handle\", handle));\n    tm_head_l.appendChild(tmn);\n    tm_head.appendChild(tm_head_l);\n    \n    var tm_x = el(\"div\");\n    tm_x.innerHTML = icons.xLogoSub;\n    tm_head.appendChild(tm_x);\n    \n    tm.appendChild(tm_head);\n\n    var txt = el(\"div\", \"tm-text\");\n    (p[1]||\"\").split(/(#[^#\\s]+)/).forEach(function(seg){\n      if(!seg) return;\n      if(seg.charAt(0) === '#') txt.appendChild(el(\"span\", \"hashtag\", seg));\n      else txt.appendChild(document.createTextNode(seg));\n    });\n    tm.appendChild(txt);\n\n    var timeStr = (p[0]||\"1m\") + \" · \" + (p[5]||\"1K\") + \" Views\";\n    tm.appendChild(el(\"div\", \"tm-meta\", timeStr));\n\n    var tm_st = el(\"div\", \"tm-stats\");\n    var st1=el(\"span\"); st1.innerHTML=\"<b>\"+(p[2]||0)+\"</b> Retweets\";\n    var st2=el(\"span\"); st2.innerHTML=\"<b>\"+(p[4]||0)+\"</b> Likes\";\n    tm_st.appendChild(st1); tm_st.appendChild(st2);\n    tm.appendChild(tm_st);\n\n    var tacts = el(\"div\", \"tm-actions\");\n    var b1=el(\"div\",\"action-btn reply\"); b1.innerHTML=icons.reply; tacts.appendChild(b1);\n    var b2=el(\"div\",\"action-btn rt\"); b2.innerHTML=icons.rt; tacts.appendChild(b2);\n    var b3=el(\"div\",\"action-btn like\"); b3.innerHTML=icons.like; bindLike(b3); tacts.appendChild(b3);\n    tm.appendChild(tacts);\n    card.appendChild(tm);\n  }\n\n  if(cmts.length) {\n    card.a